GET http://localhost:5000/api/projects/REPLACE_WITH_PROJECT_ID/materials

### Get a material by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/projects/REPLACE_WITH_PROJECT_ID/materials/REPLACE_WITH_MATERIAL_ID

### Update a material
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/projects/REPLACE_WITH_PROJECT_ID/materials/REPLACE_WITH_MATERIAL_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 120
}

### Log material usage
POST http://localhost:5000/api/projects/REPLACE_WITH_PROJECT_ID/materials/usage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "materialId": "REPLACE_WITH_MATERIAL_ID",
  "quantity": 10,
  "date": "2025-06-09"
}

