GET http://localhost:5000/api/projects/REPLACE_WITH_PROJECT_ID/materials/usage/history

### Get material stock
GET http://localhost:5000/api/projects/REPLACE_WITH_PROJECT_ID/materials/stock

### Reorder material
POST http://localhost:5000/api/projects/REPLACE_WITH_PROJECT_ID/materials/reorder
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "materialId": "REPLACE_WITH_MATERIAL_ID",
  "quantity": 50
}

### Get reorder history
GET http://localhost:5000/api/projects/REPLACE_WITH_PROJECT_ID/materials/reorder/history

